Subject: include <cstdint> in OdfGenerator.cxx

OdfGenerator.cxx uses uint8_t without including <cstdint>, and GCC 15's
libstdc++ does not declare it through <memory> or <string>.
From Alpine community/libodfgen.

diff --git a/src/OdfGenerator.cxx b/src/OdfGenerator.cxx
index f29c480..f0c9dd3 100644
--- a/src/OdfGenerator.cxx
+++ b/src/OdfGenerator.cxx
@@ -37,6 +37,7 @@
 #include <memory>
 #include <string>
 #include <stack>
+#include <cstdint>
 
 #include <librevenge/librevenge.h>
 
